    "title": "Electric field inside a cavity carved from a charged sphere (JEE Advanced type)",
    "text": "A solid insulating sphere of radius 12 cm carries a uniform volume charge density of\n2.0e-5 C/m^3. A spherical cavity is hollowed out inside it; the cavity's centre lies\n4.0 cm from the sphere's centre. Show that the field inside the cavity is uniform, and\nfind its magnitude.",
